  "bio": "Renata Lembo is a highly skilled fineline tattoo artist based in Leme, Brazil. Known for her exceptional attention to detail and precision in intricate designs, Renata's work is a testament to her professionalism in the art of tattooing. Clients commend her for maintaining a meticulously clean and hygienic studio environment, ensuring a safe and comfortable experience for everyone.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Leme, Sao Paulo, Brazil\n\nEstúdio de tatuadoras na República, São Paulo.\nTatuadora @renata.lembo\nQueremos que vc se achegue e se sinta bem por aqui.",
